// Morrow's old stones (Concept/v0.4/05, 2.6): reading code. Each stage has an old stone in its Hints, a short piece of code
// to read from the top. answer1(), answer2() and answer3() give back what that stone gives, the value its code ends with.
// Read it line by line, keep track of what each name holds, and do not run it in your head all at once.
